@startuml 07_admin_resolve_report_proposed
title Admin Resolves Report — Proposed Behavior (After Task 2.2 Fix)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #F9A825
}

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "AdminReportController\nPATCH /admin/reports/{id}/resolve" as Controller
participant "AdminReportCommandService\n.resolveReport()" as AdminSvc
participant "SessionReportRepository" as ReportRepo
participant "UserRepository\n(trust score)" as UserRepo
participant "AiTrainingService\n[PROPOSED: injected here]" as AiSvc
participant "MatchingPreferenceRepository" as PrefRepo

note over Admin
  Admin reviews the report on the admin dashboard.
  Chooses APPROVED or REJECTED with an optional resolution note.
end note

Admin -> Controller : PATCH /api/v1/admin/reports/{reportId}/resolve\n{resolution: "APPROVED" | "REJECTED", resolutionNote}

Controller -> AdminSvc : resolveReport(reportId, adminUserId, resolution, note)
AdminSvc -> ReportRepo : findById(reportId)
ReportRepo --> AdminSvc : SessionReport{status=OPEN, reporterId, reportedUserId,\n  reason, appliedTrustDelta}

AdminSvc -> AdminSvc : validate: resolution must be APPROVED or REJECTED
AdminSvc -> AdminSvc : validate: report must not already be resolved

alt resolution = APPROVED
    note over AdminSvc #E8F5E9
        Admin confirms the report is valid.
        Current behavior: just marks report as APPROVED.
        Proposed fix: NOW fire AI training on reporter.
    end note

    AdminSvc -> ReportRepo : report.approve(adminUserId, note)\n→ status=APPROVED, resolved_by, resolved_at
    AdminSvc -> ReportRepo : update(report)

    AdminSvc -> AiSvc : trainWeightsFromReport(reporterId, reason)\n[PROPOSED — fires only on APPROVED, not on submit]

    note over AiSvc #E8F5E9
        ✅ PROPOSED FIX:
        Reporter's weightBehavior is updated ONLY
        after admin confirms the report is genuine:
        • weightBehavior += 0.10 (base)
        • weightBehavior += 0.05 (SAFETY_CONCERN / PARTNER_MISCONDUCT)
        normalize() enforces MAX_WEIGHT_CAP=0.70
    end note

    AiSvc -> PrefRepo : findByUserId(reporterId)
    PrefRepo --> AiSvc : MatchingPreference
    AiSvc -> AiSvc : weightBehavior += 0.10 (base)\nweightBehavior += 0.05 (if high severity)
    AiSvc -> AiSvc : normalize() [+ MIN_TIME_WEIGHT floor after Task 1.4]
    AiSvc -> PrefRepo : save(updatedPreference)

    note over Admin
        Reported user's trust score was already
        reduced when the report was submitted.
        On APPROVED, no further trust change is needed
        (current behavior, unchanged).
    end note

    AdminSvc --> Controller : resolvedReport{status=APPROVED}
    Controller --> Admin : 200 OK

else resolution = REJECTED
    note over AdminSvc #FFE0E0
        Admin rejects the report as invalid / false.
        Current behavior: trust delta on reported user is reversed.
        Proposed fix: reporter's AI weights NOT changed (no training).
    end note

    AdminSvc -> ReportRepo : report.reject(adminUserId, note)\n→ status=REJECTED, resolved_by, resolved_at
    AdminSvc -> ReportRepo : update(report)

    AdminSvc -> AdminSvc : if appliedTrustDelta < 0:\n  reversalDelta = -appliedTrustDelta

    AdminSvc -> UserRepo : findById(reportedUserId)
    UserRepo --> AdminSvc : reportedUser{trustScore}
    AdminSvc -> AdminSvc : newScore = TrustScorePolicy.apply(trustScore, reversalDelta)
    AdminSvc -> UserRepo : save(reportedUser{trustScore=newScore})

    note over AiSvc #E8F5E9
        ✅ PROPOSED FIX:
        Reporter's AI weights are NOT changed on REJECTED.
        Since trainWeightsFromReport() was removed from
        submitReport(), there is nothing to roll back.
        The reporter's matching model stays clean.
    end note

    AdminSvc --> Controller : resolvedReport{status=REJECTED}
    Controller --> Admin : 200 OK
end

note over Admin, PrefRepo
    Summary of the proposed fix symmetry:

    | Event           | Trust (Reported) | AI Weight (Reporter) |
    |-----------------|------------------|----------------------|
    | Submit report   | -delta applied   | no change (PROPOSED) |
    | Admin APPROVED  | no change        | +0.10/+0.15 applied  |
    | Admin REJECTED  | +delta reversed  | no change            |

    Compare to current (buggy) behavior:
    | Submit report   | -delta applied   | +0.10/+0.15 applied  |
    | Admin APPROVED  | no change        | (already applied)    |
    | Admin REJECTED  | +delta reversed  | ✗ NEVER reversed     |
end note

@enduml
